g \'day!\'\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And you got sleepy and begged to be ended —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"What could it hinder so, to say?\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Tell him just how she sealed you, cautious,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"But if he ask where you are hid\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Until to-morrow, — happy letter!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Gesture, coquette, and shake your head!\\\"\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"VI.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The way I read a letter \'s this:\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"\'T is first I lock the door,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And push it with my fingers next,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"For transport it be sure.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And then I go the furthest off\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"To counteract a knock;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Then draw my little letter forth\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And softly pick its lock.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Then, glancing narrow at the wall,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And narrow at the floor,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"For firm conviction of a mouse\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Not exorcised before,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Peruse how infinite I am\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"To — no one that you know!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And sigh for lack of heaven, — but not\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The heaven the creeds bestow.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"VII.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Wild nights! Wild nights!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Were I with thee,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Wild nights should be\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Our luxury!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Futile the winds\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"To a heart in port, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Done with the compass,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Done with the chart.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Rowing in Eden!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Ah! the sea!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Might I but moor\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"To-night in thee!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"VIII.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"AT HOME.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The night was wide, and furnished scant\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"With but a single star,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"That often as a cloud it met\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Blew out itself for fear.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The wind pursued the little bush,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And drove away the leaves\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"November left; then clambered up\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And fretted in the eaves.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"No squirrel went abroad;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A dog\'s belated feet\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Like intermittent plush were heard\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Adown the empty street.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"To feel if blinds be fast,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And closer to the fire\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Her little rocking-chair to draw,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And shiver for the poor,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The housewife\'s gentle task.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"\\\"How pleasanter,\\\" said she\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Unto the sofa opposite,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"\\\"The sleet than May — no thee!\\\"\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"IX.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"POSSESSION.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Did the harebell loose her girdle\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"To the lover bee,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Would the bee the harebell hallow\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Much as formerly?\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Did the paradise, persuaded,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Yield her moat of pearl,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Would the Eden be an Eden,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Or the earl an earl?\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"X.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A charm invests a face\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Imperfectly beheld, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The lady dare not lift her veil\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"For fear it be dispelled.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"But peers beyond her mesh,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And wishes, and denies, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Lest interview annul a want\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"That image satisfies.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XI.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"THE LOVERS.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The rose did caper on her cheek,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Her bodice rose and fell,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Her pretty speech, like drunken men,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Did stagger pitiful.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Her fingers fumbled at her work, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Her needle would not go;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"What ailed so smart a little maid\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"It puzzled me to know,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Till opposite I spied a cheek\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"That bore another rose;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Just opposite, another speech\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"That like the drunkard goes;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A vest that, like the bodice, danced\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"To the immortal tune, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Till those two troubled little clocks\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Ticked softly into one.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XII.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"In lands I never saw, they say,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Immortal Alps look down,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Whose bonnets touch the firmament,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Whose sandals touch the town, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Meek at whose everlasting feet\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A myriad daisies play.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Which, sir, are you, and which am I,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Upon an August day?\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XIII.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The moon is distant from the sea,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And yet with amber hands\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"She leads him, docile as a boy,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Along appointed sands.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"He never misses a degree;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Obedient to her eye,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"He comes just so far toward the town,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Just so far goes away.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Oh, Signor, thine the amber hand,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And mine the distant sea, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Obedient to the least command\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Thine eyes impose on me.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XIV.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"He put the belt around my life, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"I heard the buckle snap,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And turned away, imperial,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"My lifetime folding up\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Deliberate, as a duke would do\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A kingdom\'s title-deed, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Henceforth a dedicated sort,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A member of the cloud.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Yet not too far to come at call,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And do the little toils\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"That make the circuit of the rest,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And deal occasional smiles\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"To lives that stoop to notice mine\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And kindly ask it in, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Whose invitation, knew you not\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"For whom I must decline?\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XV.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"THE LOST JEWEL.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"I held a jewel in my fingers\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And went to sleep.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The day was warm, and winds were prosy;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"I said: \\\"\'T will keep.\\\"\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"I woke and chid my honest fingers, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The gem was gone;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And now an amethyst remembrance\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Is all I own.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XVI.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"What if I say I shall not wait?\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"What if I burst the fleshly gate\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And pass, escaped, to thee?\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"What if I file this mortal off,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"See where it hurt me, — that \'s enough, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And wade in liberty?\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"They cannot take us any more, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Dungeons may call, and guns implore;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Unmeaning now, to me,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"As laughter was an hour ago,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Or laces, or a travelling show,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Or who died yesterday!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"III. NATURE.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"I.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"MOTHER NATURE.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Nature, the gentlest mother,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Impatient of no child,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The feeblest or the waywardest, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Her admonition mild\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"In forest and the hill\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"By traveller is heard,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Restraining rampant squirrel\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Or too impetuous bird.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"How fair her conversation,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A summer afternoon, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Her household, her assembly;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And when the sun goes down\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Her voice among the aisles\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Incites the timid prayer\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Of the minutest cricket,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The most unworthy flower.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"When all the children sleep\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"She turns as long away\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"As will suffice to light her lamps;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Then, bending from the sky\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"With infinite affection\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And infiniter care,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Her golden finger on her lip,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Wills silence everywhere.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"II.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"OUT OF THE MORNING.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Will there really be a morning?\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Is there such a thing as day?\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Could I see it from the mountains\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"If I were as tall as they?\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Has it feet like water-lilies?\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Has it feathers like a bird?\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Is it brought from famous countries\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Of which I have never heard?\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Oh, some scholar! Oh, some sailor!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Oh, some wise man from the skies!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Please to tell a little pilgrim\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Where the place called morning lies!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"III.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"At half-past three a single bird\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Unto a silent sky\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Propounded but a single term\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Of cautious melody.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"At half-past four, experiment\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Had subjugated test,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And lo! her silver principle\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Supplanted all the rest.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"At half-past seven, element\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Nor implement was seen,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And place was where the presence was,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Circumference between.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"IV.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"DAY\'S PARLOR.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The day came slow, till five o\'clock,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Then sprang before the hills\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Like hindered rubies, or the light\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A sudden musket spills.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The purple could not keep the east,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The sunrise shook from fold,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Like breadths of topaz, packed a night,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The lady just unrolled.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The happy winds their timbrels took;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The birds, in docile rows,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Arranged themselves around their prince\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"(The wind is prince of those).\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The orchard sparkled like a Jew, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"How mighty \'t was, to stay\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A guest in this stupendous place,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The parlor of the day!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"V.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"THE SUN\'S WOOING.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The sun just touched the morning;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The morning, happy thing,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Supposed that he had come to dwell,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And life would be all spring.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"She felt herself supremer, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A raised, ethereal thing;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Henceforth for her what holiday!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Meanwhile, her wheeling king\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Trailed slow along the orchards\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"His haughty, spangled hems,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Leaving a new necessity, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The want of diadems!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The morning fluttered, staggered,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Felt feebly for her crown, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Her unanointed forehead\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Henceforth her only one.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"VI.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"THE ROBIN.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The robin is the one\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"That interrupts the morn\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"With hurried, few, express reports\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"When March is scarcely on.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The robin is the one\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"That overflows the noon\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"With her cherubic quantity,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"An April but begun.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The robin is the one\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"That speechless from her nest\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Submits that home and certainty\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And sanctity are best.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"VII.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"THE BUTTERFLY\'S DAY.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"From cocoon forth a butterfly\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"As lady from her door\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Emerged — a summer afternoon —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Repairing everywhere,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Without design, that I could trace,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Except to stray abroad\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"On miscellaneous enterprise\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The clovers understood.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Her pretty parasol was seen\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Contracting in a field\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Where men made hay, then struggling hard\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"With an opposing cloud,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Where parties, phantom as herself,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"To Nowhere seemed to go\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"In purposeless circumference,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"As \'t were a tropic show.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And notwithstanding bee that worked,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And flower that zealous blew,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"This audience of idleness\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Disdained them, from the sky,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Till sundown crept, a steady tide,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And men that made the hay,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And afternoon, and butterfly,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Extinguished in its sea.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"VIII.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"THE BLUEBIRD.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Before you thought of spring,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Except as a surmise,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"You see, God bless his suddenness,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A fellow in the skies\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Of independent hues,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A little weather-worn,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Inspiriting habiliments\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Of indigo and brown.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"With specimens of song,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"As if for you to choose,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Discretion in the interval,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"With gay delays he goes\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"To some superior tree\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Without a single leaf,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And shouts for joy to nobody\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"But his seraphic self!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"IX.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"APRIL.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"An altered look about the hills;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A Tyrian light the village fills;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A wider sunrise in the dawn;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A deeper twilight on the lawn;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A print of a vermilion foot;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A purple finger on the slope;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A flippant fly upon the pane;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A spider at his trade again;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"An added strut in chanticleer;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A flower expected everywhere;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"An axe shrill singing in the woods;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Fern-odors on untravelled roads, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"All this, and more I cannot tell,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A furtive look you know as well,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And Nicodemus\' mystery\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Receives its annual reply.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"X.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"THE SLEEPING FLOWERS.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"\\\"Whose are the little beds,\\\" I asked,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"\\\"Which in the valleys lie?\\\"\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Some shook their heads, and others smiled,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And no one made reply.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"\\\"Perhaps they did not hear,\\\" I said;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"\\\"I will inquire again.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Whose are the beds, the tiny beds\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"So thick upon the plain?\\\"\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"\\\"\'T is daisy in the shortest;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A little farther on,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Nearest the door to wake the first,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Little leontodon.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"\\\"\'T is iris, sir, and aster,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Anemone and bell,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Batschia in the blanket red,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And chubby daffodil.\\\"\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Meanwhile at many cradles\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Her busy foot she plied,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Humming the quaintest lullaby\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"That ever rocked a child.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"\\\"Hush! Epigea wakens! —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The crocus stirs her lids,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Rhodora\'s cheek is crimson, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"She\'s dreaming of the woods.\\\"\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Then, turning from them, reverent,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"\\\"Their bed-time \'t is,\\\" she said;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"\\\"The bumble-bees will wake them\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"When April woods are red.\\\"\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XI.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"MY ROSE.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Pigmy seraphs gone astray,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Velvet people from Vevay,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Belles from some lost summer day,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Bees\' exclusive coterie.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Paris could not lay the fold\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Belted down with emerald;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Venice could not show a cheek\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Of a tint so lustrous meek.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Never such an ambuscade\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"As of brier and leaf displayed\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"For my little damask maid.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"I had rather wear her grace\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Than an earl\'s distinguished face;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"I had rather dwell like her\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Than be Duke of Exeter\"