,{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Amid no bells nor bravos\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The bystanders will tell!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Cheerful, as to the village,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Tranquil, as to repose,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Chastened, as to the chapel,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"This humble tourist rose.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Did not talk of returning,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Alluded to no time\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"When, were the gales propitious,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"We might look for him;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Was grateful for the roses\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"In life\'s diverse bouquet,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Talked softly of new species\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"To pick another day.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Beguiling thus the wonder,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The wondrous nearer drew;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Hands bustled at the moorings —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The crowd respectful grew.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Ascended from our vision\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"To countenances new!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A difference, a daisy,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Is all the rest I knew!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XXXIII.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"REQUIEM.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Taken from men this morning,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Carried by men to-day,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Met by the gods with banners\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Who marshalled her away.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"One little maid from playmates,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"One little mind from school, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"There must be guests in Eden;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"All the rooms are full.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Far as the east from even,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Dim as the border star, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Courtiers quaint, in kingdoms,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Our departed are.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XXXIV.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"What inn is this\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Where for the night\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Peculiar traveller comes?\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Who is the landlord?\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Where the maids?\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Behold, what curious rooms!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"No ruddy fires on the hearth,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"No brimming tankards flow.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Necromancer, landlord,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Who are these below?\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XXXV.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"It was not death, for I stood up,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And all the dead lie down;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"It was not night, for all the bells\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Put out their tongues, for noon.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"It was not frost, for on my flesh\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"I felt siroccos crawl, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Nor fire, for just my marble feet\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Could keep a chancel cool.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And yet it tasted like them all;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The figures I have seen\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Set orderly, for burial,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Reminded me of mine,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"As if my life were shaven\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And fitted to a frame,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And could not breathe without a key;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And \'t was like midnight, some,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"When everything that ticked has stopped,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And space stares, all around,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Or grisly frosts, first autumn morns,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Repeal the beating ground.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"But most like chaos, — stopless, cool, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Without a chance or spar,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Or even a report of land\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"To justify despair.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XXXVI.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"TILL THE END.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"I should not dare to leave my friend,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Because — because if he should die\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"While I was gone, and I — too late —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Should reach the heart that wanted me;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"If I should disappoint the eyes\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"That hunted, hunted so, to see,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And could not bear to shut until\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"They \\\"noticed\\\" me — they noticed me;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"If I should stab the patient faith\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"So sure I \'d come — so sure I \'d come,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"It listening, listening, went to sleep\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Telling my tardy name, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"My heart would wish it broke before,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Since breaking then, since breaking then,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Were useless as next morning\'s sun,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Where midnight frosts had lain!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XXXVII.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"VOID.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Great streets of silence led away\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"To neighborhoods of pause;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Here was no notice, no dissent,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"No universe, no laws.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"By clocks \'t was morning, and for night\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The bells at distance called;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"But epoch had no basis here,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"For period exhaled.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XXXVIII.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A throe upon the features\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A hurry in the breath,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"An ecstasy of parting\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Denominated \\\"Death,\\\" —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"An anguish at the mention,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Which, when to patience grown,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"I \'ve known permission given\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"To rejoin its own.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XXXIX.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"SAVED!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Of tribulation these are they\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Denoted by the white;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The spangled gowns, a lesser rank\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Of victors designate.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"All these did conquer; but the ones\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Who overcame most times\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Wear nothing commoner than snow,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"No ornament but palms.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Surrender is a sort unknown\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"On this superior soil;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Defeat, an outgrown anguish,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Remembered as the mile\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Our panting ankle barely gained\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"When night devoured the road;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"But we stood whispering in the house,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And all we said was \\\"Saved\\\"!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XL.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"I think just how my shape will rise\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"When I shall be forgiven,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Till hair and eyes and timid head\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Are out of sight, in heaven.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"I think just how my lips will weigh\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"With shapeless, quivering prayer\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"That you, so late, consider me,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The sparrow of your care.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"I mind me that of anguish sent,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Some drifts were moved away\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Before my simple bosom broke, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And why not this, if they?\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And so, until delirious borne\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"I con that thing, — \\\"forgiven,\\\" —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Till with long fright and longer trust\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"I drop my heart, unshriven!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XLI.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"THE FORGOTTEN GRAVE.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"After a hundred years\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Nobody knows the place, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Agony, that enacted there,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Motionless as peace.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Weeds triumphant ranged,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Strangers strolled and spelled\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"At the lone orthography\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Of the elder dead.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Winds of summer fields\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Recollect the way, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Instinct picking up the key\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Dropped by memory.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XLII.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Lay this laurel on the one\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Too intrinsic for renown.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Laurel! veil your deathless tree, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Him you chasten, that is he!\"}]},{\"title\":\"Third Series\",\"blocks\":[{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Edited by\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"MABEL LOOMIS TODD\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"It\'s all I have to bring to-day,\\n This, and my heart beside,\\nThis, and my heart, and all the fields,\\n And all the meadows wide.\\nBe sure you count, should I forget, —\\n Some one the sum could tell, —\\nThis, and my heart, and all the bees\\n Which in the clover dwell.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"PREFACE.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The intellectual activity of Emily Dickinson was so great that\\na large and characteristic choice is still possible among her\\nliterary material, and this third volume of her verses is put\\nforth in response to the repeated wish of the admirers of her\\npeculiar genius. Much of Emily Dickinson\'s prose was rhythmic,\\n—even rhymed, though frequently not set apart in lines.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Also many verses, written as such, were sent to friends in\\nletters; these were published in 1894, in the volumes of her\\nLetters. It has not been necessary, however, to include them in\\nthis Series, and all have been omitted, except three or four\\nexceptionally strong ones, as \\\"A Book,\\\" and \\\"With Flowers.\\\"\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"There is internal evidence that many of the poems were simply\\nspontaneous flashes of insight, apparently unrelated to outward\\ncircumstance. Others, however, had an obvious personal origin;\\nfor example, the verses \\\"I had a Guinea golden,\\\" which seem to\\nhave been sent to some friend travelling in Europe, as a dainty\\nreminder of letter-writing delinquencies. The surroundings in\\nwhich any of Emily Dickinson\'s verses are known to have been\\nwritten usually serve to explain them clearly; but in general the\\npresent volume is full of thoughts needing no interpretation to\\nthose who apprehend this scintillating spirit.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"M. L. T.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"AMHERST, October, 1896.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"I. LIFE.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"I.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"REAL RICHES.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"\'T is little I could care for pearls\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Who own the ample sea;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Or brooches, when the Emperor\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"With rubies pelteth me;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Or gold, who am the Prince of Mines;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Or diamonds, when I see\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A diadem to fit a dome\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Continual crowning me.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"II.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"SUPERIORITY TO FATE.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Superiority to fate\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Is difficult to learn.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"\'T is not conferred by any,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"But possible to earn\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A pittance at a time,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Until, to her surprise,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The soul with strict economy\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Subsists till Paradise.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"III.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"HOPE.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Hope is a subtle glutton;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"He feeds upon the fair;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And yet, inspected closely,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"What abstinence is there!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"His is the halcyon table\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"That never seats but one,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And whatsoever is consumed\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The same amounts remain.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"IV.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"FORBIDDEN FRUIT.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"I.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Forbidden fruit a flavor has\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"That lawful orchards mocks;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"How luscious lies the pea within\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The pod that Duty locks!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"V.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"FORBIDDEN FRUIT.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"II.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Heaven is what I cannot reach!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The apple on the tree,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Provided it do hopeless hang,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"That \'heaven\' is, to me.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The color on the cruising cloud,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The interdicted ground\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Behind the hill, the house behind, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"There Paradise is found!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"VI.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A WORD.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A word is dead\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"When it is said,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Some say.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"I say it just\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Begins to live\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"That day.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"VII.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"To venerate the simple days\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Which lead the seasons by,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Needs but to remember\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"That from you or me\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"They may take the trifle\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Termed mortality!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"To invest existence with a stately air,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Needs but to remember\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"That the acorn there\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Is the egg of forests\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"For the upper air!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"VIII.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"LIFE\'S TRADES.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"It\'s such a little thing to weep,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"So short a thing to sigh;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And yet by trades the size of these\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"We men and women die!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"IX.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Drowning is not so pitiful\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"As the attempt to rise.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Three times, \'t is said, a sinking man\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Comes up to face the skies,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And then declines forever\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"To that abhorred abode\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Where hope and he part company, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"For he is grasped of God.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The Maker\'s cordial visage,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"However good to see,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Is shunned, we must admit it,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Like an adversity.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"X.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"How still the bells in steeples stand,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Till, swollen with the sky,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"They leap upon their silver feet\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"In frantic melody!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XI.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"If the foolish call them \'flowers,\'\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Need the wiser tell?\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"If the savans \'classify\' them,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"It is just as well!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Those who read the Revelations\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Must not criticise\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Those who read the same edition\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"With beclouded eyes!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Could we stand with that old Moses\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Canaan denied, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Scan, like him, the stately landscape\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"On the other side, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Doubtless we should deem superfluous\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Many sciences\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Not pursued by learnèd angels\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"In scholastic skies!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Low amid that glad\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Belles lettres\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Grant that we may stand,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Stars, amid profound Galaxies,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"At that grand \'Right hand\'!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XII.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A SYLLABLE.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Could mortal lip divine\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The undeveloped freight\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Of a delivered syllable,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"\'T would crumble with the weight.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XIII.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"PARTING.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"My life closed twice before its close;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"It yet remains to see\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"If Immortality unveil\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A third event to me,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"So huge, so hopeless to conceive,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"As these that twice befell.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Parting is all we know of heaven,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And all we need of hell.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XIV.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"ASPIRATION.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"We never know how high we are\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Till we are called to rise;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And then, if we are true to plan,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Our statures touch the skies.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The heroism we recite\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Would be a daily thing,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Did not ourselves the cubits warp\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"For fear to be a king.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XV.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"THE INEVITABLE.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"While I was fearing it, it came,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"But came with less of fear,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Because that fearing it so long\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Had almost made it dear.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"There is a fitting a dismay,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A fitting a despair.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"\'Tis harder knowing it is due,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Than knowing it is here.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The trying on the utmost,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The morning it is new,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Is terribler than wearing it\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A whole existence through.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XVI.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A BOOK.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"There is no frigate like a book\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"To take us lands away,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Nor any coursers like a page\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Of prancing poetry.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"This traverse may the poorest take\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Without oppress of toll;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"How frugal is the chariot\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"That bears a human soul!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XVII.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Who has not found the heaven below\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Will fail of it above.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"God\'s residence is next to mine,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"His furniture is love.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XVIII.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A PORTRAIT.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A face devoid of love or grace,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A hateful, hard, successful face,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A face with which a stone\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Would feel as thoroughly at ease\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"As were they old acquaintances, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"First time together thrown.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XIX.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"I HAD A GUINEA GOLDEN.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"I had a guinea golden;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"I lost it in the sand,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And though the sum was simple,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And pounds were in the land,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Still had it such a value\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Unto my frugal eye,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"That when I could not find it\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"I sat me down to sigh.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"I had a crimson robin\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Who sang full many a day,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"But when the woods were painted\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"He, too, did fly away.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Time brought me other robins, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Their ballads were the same, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Still for my missing troubadour\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"I kept the \'house at hame.\'\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"I had a star in heaven;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"One Pleiad was its name,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And when I was not heeding\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"It wandered from the same.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And though the skies are crowded,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And all the night ashine,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"I do not care about it,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Since none of them are mine.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"My story has a moral:\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"I have a missing friend, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Pleiad its name, and robin,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And guinea in the sand, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And when this mournful ditty,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Accompanied with tear,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Shall meet the eye of traitor\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"In country far from here,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Grant that repentance solemn\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"May seize upon his mind,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And he no consolation\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Beneath the sun may find.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"NOTE. — This poem may have had, like many others, a\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"personal origin. It is more than probable that it was\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"sent to some friend travelling in Europe, a dainty\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"reminder of letter-writing delinquencies.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XX.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"SATURDAY AFTERNOON.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"From all the jails the boys and girls\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Ecstatically leap, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Beloved, only afternoon\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"That prison doesn\'t keep.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"They storm the earth and stun the air,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A mob of solid bliss.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Alas! that frowns could lie in wait\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"For such a foe as this!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XXI.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Few get enough, — enough is one;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"To that ethereal throng\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Have not each one of us the right\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"To stealthily belong?\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XXII.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Upon the gallows hung a wretch,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Too sullied for the hell\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"To which the law entitled him.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"As nature\'s curtain fell\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The one who bore him tottered in,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"For this was woman\'s son.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"\'\'T was all I had,\' she stricken gasped;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Oh, what a livid boon!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XXIII.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"THE LOST THOUGHT.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"I felt a clearing in my mind\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"As if my brain had split;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"I tried to match it, seam by seam,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"But could not make them fit.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The thought behind I strove to join\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Unto the thought before,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"But sequence ravelled out of reach\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Like balls upon a floor.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XXIV.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"RETICENCE.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The reticent volcano keeps\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"His never slumbering plan;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Confided are his projects pink\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"To no precarious man.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"If nature will not tell the tale\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Jehovah told to her,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Can human nature not survive\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Without a listener?\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Admonished by her buckled lips\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Let every babbler be.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The only secret people keep\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Is Immortality.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XXV.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"WITH FLOWERS.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"If recollecting were forgetting,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Then I remember not;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And if forgetting, recollecting,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"How near I had forgot!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And if to miss were merry,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And if to mourn were gay,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"How very blithe the fingers\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"That gathered these to-day!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XXVI.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The farthest thunder that I heard\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Was nearer than the sky,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And rumbles still, though torrid noons\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Have lain their missiles by.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The lightning that preceded it\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Struck no one but myself,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"But I would not exchange the bolt\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"For all the rest of life.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Indebtedness to oxygen\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The chemist may repay,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"But not the obligation\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"To electricity.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"It founds the homes and decks the days,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And every clamor bright\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Is but the gleam concomitant\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Of that waylaying light.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The thought is quiet as a flake, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A crash without a sound;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"How life\'s reverberation\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Its explanation found!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XXVII.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"On the bleakness of my lot\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Bloom I strove to raise.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Late, my acre of a rock\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Yielded grape and maize.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Soil of flint if steadfast tilled\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Will reward the hand;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Seed of palm by Lybian sun\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Fructified in sand.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XXVIII.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"CONTRAST.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A door just opened on a street —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"I, lost, was passing by —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"An instant\'s width of warmth disclosed,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And wealth, and company.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The door as sudden shut, and I,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"I, lost, was passing by, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Lost doubly, but by contrast most,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Enlightening misery.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XXIX.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"FRIENDS.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Are friends delight or pain?\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Could bounty but remain\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Riches were good.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"But if they only stay\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Bolder to fly away,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Riches are sad.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XXX.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"FIRE.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Ashes denote that fire was;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Respect the grayest pile\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"For the departed creature\'s sake\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"That hovered there awhile.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Fire exists the first in light,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And then consolidates, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Only the chemist can disclose\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Into what carbonates.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XXXI.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A MAN.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Fate slew him, but he did not drop;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"She felled — he did not fall —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Impaled him on her fiercest stakes —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"He neutralized them all.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"She stung him, sapped his firm advance,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"But, when her worst was done,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And he, unmoved, regarded her,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Acknowledged him a man.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XXXII.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"VENTURES.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Finite to fail, but infinite to venture.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"For the one ship that struts the shore\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Many\'s the gallant, overwhelmed creature\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Nodding in navies nevermore.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XXXIII.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"GRIEFS.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"I measure every grief I meet\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"With analytic eyes;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"I wonder if it weighs like mine,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Or has an easier size.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"I wonder if they bore it long,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Or did it just begin?\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"I could not tell the date of mine,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"It feels so old a pain.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"I wonder if it hurts to live,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And if they have to try,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And whether, could they choose between,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"They would not rather die.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"I wonder if when years have piled —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Some thousands — on the cause\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Of early hurt, if such a lapse\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Could give them any pause;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Or would they go on aching still\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Through centuries above,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Enlightened to a larger pain\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"By contrast with the love.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The grieved are many, I am told;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The reason deeper lies, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Death is but one and comes but once,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And only nails the eyes.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"There\'s grief of want, and grief of cold, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A sort they call \'despair;\'\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"There\'s banishment from native eyes,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"In sight of native air.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And though I may not guess the kind\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Correctly, yet to me\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A piercing comfort it affords\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"In passing Calvary,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"To note the fashions of the cross,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Of those that stand alone,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Still fascinated to presume\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"That some are like my own.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XXXIV.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"I have a king who does not speak;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"So, wondering, thro\' the hours meek\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"I trudge the day away,—\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Half glad when it is night and sleep,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"If, haply, thro\' a dream to peep\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"In parlors shut by day.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And if I do, when morning comes,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"It is as if a hundred drums\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Did round my pillow roll,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And shouts fill all my childish sky,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And bells keep saying \'victory\'\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"From steeples in my soul!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And if I don\'t, the little Bird\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Within the Orchard is not heard,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And I omit to pray,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"\'Father, thy will be done\' to-day,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"For my will goes the other way,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And it were perjury!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XXXV.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"DISENCHANTMENT.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"It dropped so low in my regard\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"I heard it hit the ground,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And go to pieces on the stones\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"At bottom of my mind;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Yet blamed the fate that fractured, less\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Than I reviled myself\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"For entertaining plated wares\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Upon my silver shelf.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XXXVI.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"LOST FAITH.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"To lose one\'s faith surpasses\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The loss of an estate,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Because estates can be\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Replenished, — faith cannot.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Inherited with life,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Belief but once can be;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Annihilate a single clause,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And Being\'s beggary.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XXXVII.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"LOST JOY.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"I had a daily bliss\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"I half indifferent viewed,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Till sudden I perceived it stir, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"It grew as I pursued,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Till when, around a crag,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"It wasted from my sight,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Enlarged beyond my utmost scope,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"I learned its sweetness right.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XXXVIII.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"I worked for chaff, and earning wheat\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Was haughty and betrayed.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"What right had fields to arbitrate\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"In matters ratified?\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"I tasted wheat, — and hated chaff,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And thanked the ample friend;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Wisdom is more becoming viewed\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"At distance than at hand.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XXXIX.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Life, and Death, and Giants\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Such as these, are still.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Minor apparatus, hopper of the mill,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Beetle at the candle,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Or a fife\'s small fame,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Maintain by accident\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"That they proclaim.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XL.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"ALPINE GLOW.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Our lives are Swiss, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"So still, so cool,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Till, some odd afternoon,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The Alps neglect their curtains,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And we look farther on.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Italy stands the other side,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"While, like a guard between,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The solemn Alps,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The siren Alps,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Forever intervene!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XLI.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"REMEMBRANCE.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Remembrance has a rear and front, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"\'T is something like a house;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"It has a garret also\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"For refuse and the mouse,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Besides, the deepest cellar\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"That ever mason hewed;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Look to it, by its fathoms\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Ourselves be not pursued.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XLII.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"To hang our head ostensibly,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And subsequent to find\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"That such was not the posture\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Of our immortal mind,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Affords the sly presumption\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"That, in so dense a fuzz,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"You, too, take cobweb attitudes\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Upon a plane of gauze!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XLIII.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"THE BRAIN.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The brain is wider than the sky,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"For, put them side by side,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The one the other will include\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"With ease, and you beside.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The brain is deeper than the sea,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"For, hold them, blue to blue,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The one the other will absorb,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"As sponges, buckets do.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The brain is just the weight of God,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"For, lift them, pound for pound,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And they will differ, if they do,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"As syllable from sound.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XLIV.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The bone that has no marrow;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"What ultimate for that?\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"It is not fit for table,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"For beggar, or for cat.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A bone has obligations,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A being has the same;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A marrowless assembly\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Is culpabler than shame.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"But how shall finished creatures\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A function fresh obtain? —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Old Nicodemus\' phantom\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Confronting us again!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XLV.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"THE PAST.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The past is such a curious creature,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"To look her in the face\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A transport may reward us,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Or a disgrace.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Unarmed if any meet her,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"I charge him, fly!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Her rusty ammunition\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Might yet reply!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XLVI.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"To help our bleaker parts\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Salubrious hours are given,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Which if they do not fit for earth\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Drill silently for heaven.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XLVII.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"What soft, cherubic creatures\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"These gentlewomen are!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"One would as soon assault a plush\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Or violate a star.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Such dimity convictions,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A horror so refined\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Of freckled human nature,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Of Deity ashamed, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"It\'s such a common glory,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A fisherman\'s degree!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Redemption, brittle lady,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Be so, ashamed of thee.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XLVIII.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"DESIRE.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Who never wanted, — maddest joy\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Remains to him unknown:\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The banquet of abstemiousness\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Surpasses that of wine.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Within its hope, though yet ungrasped\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Desire\'s perfect goal,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"No nearer, lest reality\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Should disenthrall thy soul.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XLIX.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"PHILOSOPHY.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"It might be easier\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"To fail with land in sight,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Than gain my blue peninsula\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"To perish of delight.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"L.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"POWER.\"},{\"h