nd no man visit me,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And flirt all day with buttercups,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And marry whom I may,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And dwell a little everywhere,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Or better, run away\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"With no police to follow,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Or chase me if I do,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Till I should jump peninsulas\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"To get away from you, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"I said, but just to be a bee\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Upon a raft of air,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And row in nowhere all day long,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And anchor off the bar,—\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"What liberty! So captives deem\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Who tight in dungeons are.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XXI.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"THE MOON.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The moon was but a chin of gold\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A night or two ago,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And now she turns her perfect face\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Upon the world below.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Her forehead is of amplest blond;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Her cheek like beryl stone;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Her eye unto the summer dew\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The likest I have known.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Her lips of amber never part;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"But what must be the smile\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Upon her friend she could bestow\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Were such her silver will!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And what a privilege to be\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"But the remotest star!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"For certainly her way might pass\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Beside your twinkling door.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Her bonnet is the firmament,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The universe her shoe,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The stars the trinkets at her belt,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Her dimities of blue.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XXII.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"THE BAT.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The bat is dun with wrinkled wings\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Like fallow article,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And not a song pervades his lips,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Or none perceptible.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"His small umbrella, quaintly halved,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Describing in the air\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"An arc alike inscrutable, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Elate philosopher!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Deputed from what firmament\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Of what astute abode,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Empowered with what malevolence\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Auspiciously withheld.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"To his adroit Creator\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Ascribe no less the praise;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Beneficent, believe me,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"His eccentricities.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XXIII.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"THE BALLOON.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"You\'ve seen balloons set, haven\'t you?\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"So stately they ascend\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"It is as swans discarded you\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"For duties diamond.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Their liquid feet go softly out\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Upon a sea of blond;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"They spurn the air as \'t were too mean\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"For creatures so renowned.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Their ribbons just beyond the eye,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"They struggle some for breath,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And yet the crowd applauds below;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"They would not encore death.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The gilded creature strains and spins,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Trips frantic in a tree,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Tears open her imperial veins\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And tumbles in the sea.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The crowd retire with an oath\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The dust in streets goes down,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And clerks in counting-rooms observe,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"\'\'T was only a balloon.\'\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XXIV.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"EVENING.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The cricket sang,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And set the sun,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And workmen finished, one by one,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Their seam the day upon.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The low grass loaded with the dew,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The twilight stood as strangers do\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"With hat in hand, polite and new,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"To stay as if, or go.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A vastness, as a neighbor, came, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A wisdom without face or name,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A peace, as hemispheres at home, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And so the night became.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XXV.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"COCOON.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Drab habitation of whom?\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Tabernacle or tomb,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Or dome of worm,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Or porch of gnome,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Or some elf\'s catacomb?\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XXVI.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"SUNSET.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A sloop of amber slips away\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Upon an ether sea,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And wrecks in peace a purple tar,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\"