,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"As if a duchess pass!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"How a small dusk crawls on the village\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Till the houses blot;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And the odd flambeaux no men carry\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Glimmer on the spot!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Now it is night in nest and kennel,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And where was the wood,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Just a dome of abyss is nodding\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Into solitude! —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"These are the visions baffled Guido;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Titian never told;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Domenichino dropped the pencil,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Powerless to unfold.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XXIX.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"AFTERMATH.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The murmuring of bees has ceased;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"But murmuring of some\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Posterior, prophetic,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Has simultaneous come, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The lower metres of the year,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"When nature\'s laugh is done, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The Revelations of the book\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Whose Genesis is June.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"IV. TIME AND ETERNITY.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"I.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"This world is not conclusion;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A sequel stands beyond,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Invisible, as music,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"But positive, as sound.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"It beckons and it baffles;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Philosophies don\'t know,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And through a riddle, at the last,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Sagacity must go.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"To guess it puzzles scholars;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"To gain it, men have shown\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Contempt of generations,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And crucifixion known.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"II.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"We learn in the retreating\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"How vast an one\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Was recently among us.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A perished sun\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Endears in the departure\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"How doubly more\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Than all the golden presence\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"It was before!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"III.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"They say that \'time assuages,\' —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Time never did assuage;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"An actual suffering strengthens,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"As sinews do, with age.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Time is a test of trouble,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"But not a remedy.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"If such it prove, it prove too\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"There was no malady.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"IV.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"We cover thee, sweet face.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Not that we tire of thee,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"But that thyself fatigue of us;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Remember, as thou flee,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"We follow thee until\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Thou notice us no more,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And then, reluctant, turn away\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"To con thee o\'er and o\'er,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And blame the scanty love\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"We were content to show,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Augmented, sweet, a hundred fold\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"If thou would\'st take it now.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"V.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"ENDING.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"That is solemn we have ended, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Be it but a play,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Or a glee among the garrets,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Or a holiday,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Or a leaving home; or later,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Parting with a world\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"We have understood, for better\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Still it be unfurled.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"VI.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The stimulus, beyond the grave\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"His countenance to see,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Supports me like imperial drams\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Afforded royally.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"VII.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Given in marriage unto thee,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Oh, thou celestial host!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Bride of the Father and the Son,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Bride of the Holy Ghost!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Other betrothal shall dissolve,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Wedlock of will decay;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Only the keeper of this seal\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Conquers mortality.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"VIII.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"That such have died enables us\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The tranquiller to die;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"That such have lived, certificate\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"For immortality.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"IX.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"They won\'t frown always, — some sweet day\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"When I forget to tease,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"They\'ll recollect how cold I looked,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And how I just said \'please.\'\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Then they will hasten to the door\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"To call the little child,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Who cannot thank them, for the ice\"