"Extinct be every hum,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Whose garden wrestles with the dew,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"At daybreak overcome!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XIII.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"DEATH.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Death is like the insect\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Menacing the tree,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Competent to kill it,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"But decoyed may be.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Bait it with the balsam,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Seek it with the knife,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Baffle, if it cost you\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Everything in life.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Then, if it have burrowed\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Out of reach of skill,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Ring the tree and leave it, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"\'T is the vermin\'s will.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XIV.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"UNWARNED.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"\'T is sunrise, little maid, hast thou\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"No station in the day?\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"\'T was not thy wont to hinder so, —\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Retrieve thine industry.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"\'T is noon, my little maid, alas!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And art thou sleeping yet?\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The lily waiting to be wed,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The bee, dost thou forget?\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"My little maid, \'t is night; alas,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"That night should be to thee\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Instead of morning! Hadst thou broached\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Thy little plan to me,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Dissuade thee if I could not, sweet,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"I might have aided thee.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XV.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Each that we lose takes part of us;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"A crescent still abides,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Which like the moon, some turbid night,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Is summoned by the tides.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XVI.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Not any higher stands the grave\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"For heroes than for men;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Not any nearer for the child\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Than numb three-score and ten.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"This latest leisure equal lulls\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"The beggar and his queen;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Propitiate this democrat\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"By summer\'s gracious mien.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XVII.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"ASLEEP.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"As far from pity as complaint,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"As cool to speech as stone,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"As numb to revelation\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"As if my trade were bone.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"As far from time as history,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"As near yourself to-day\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"As children to the rainbow\'s scarf,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Or sunset\'s yellow play\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"To eyelids in the sepulchre.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"How still the dancer lies,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"While color\'s revelations break,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"And blaze the butterflies!\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"XVIII.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"THE SPIRIT.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"\'T is whiter than an Indian pipe,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"\'T is dimmer than a lace;\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"No stature has it, like a fog,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"When you approach the place.\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Not any voice denotes it here,\"},{\"heading\":false,\"text\":\"Or intimates it there;\"},{\"heading\":fals